            "body": "If I understand correctly, then the issue is about `custom_textobjects = { xv = {...} }` not working as custom textobject. This is an expected behavior because [only single character](https://github.com/echasnovski/mini.nvim/blob/9968f6e221ae7bdac57a910c5bf2026186aa023c/doc/mini-ai.txt#L37-L41) can to be a textobject identifier.\r\n\r\nClosing as not an issue.",
